{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve cozy, food-themed 3D puzzles in a hand-painted world. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, rotate and organize woodeen blocks to discover satisfying little scenes full of cute animals, gentle logic, and soothing sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique hand-painted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals to pet in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing and satisfying sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, stress-free gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.poster.avif?t=1773985871\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.webm?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.mp4?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UMAMI is designed to soothe, not stress. Every puzzle is a peaceful invitation to explore a world built around gentle logic, satisfying sounds, and soft visuals. No timers, no wrong moves, just a cozy space to unwind and enjoy playful problem-solving at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/58853ed7c380d6372f1b9f342758d5d0.poster.avif?t=1773985871\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/58853ed7c380d6372f1b9f342758d5d0.webm?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/58853ed7c380d6372f1b9f342758d5d0.mp4?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle diorama is hand-painted with care, featuring mouthwatering dishes and adorable animal companions. Whether you\u2019re stacking pancakes, arranging onigiris, or petting a cute panda, every scene is full of life, charm, and little moments of joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/cf82f0d915f7f6e076c3b23514f1aca6.poster.avif?t=1773985871\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/cf82f0d915f7f6e076c3b23514f1aca6.webm?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/cf82f0d915f7f6e076c3b23514f1aca6.mp4?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the main puzzles, UMAMI rewards curiosity. Subtle animations, collectible cards, and playful surprises are tucked away for those who look closely. Combined with tactile clicks, warm soundscapes, and visual details, every interaction is designed to feel delightful and immersive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/daf4999c04c2408c745ea0e9bd004129.avif?t=1773985871\" width=780 height=260 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://c