":3743630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve cozy, food-themed 3D puzzles in a hand-painted world. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, rotate and organize woodeen blocks to discover satisfying little scenes full of cute animals, gentle logic, and soothing sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique hand-painted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals to pet in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing and satisfying sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, stress-free gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.poster.avif?t=1773985871\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.webm?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/36bd9ab36cd405d0f582abef02546a56.mp4?t=1773985871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UMAMI is designed to soothe, not stress. Every puzzle is a peaceful invitation to explore a world built around gentle logic, satisfying sounds, and soft visuals. No timers, no wrong moves, just a cozy space to unwind and enjoy playful problem-solving at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/extras/58853ed7c380d6372f1b9f342758d5d